{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has a high degree of freedom, you can customize the protagonist, and the characters encountered in each game are different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character can be equipped with 6 different weapons, each with unique active skills. You can learn different skills through the skill book to match them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has their own characteristics (passive skills), and you can also combine them by learning new characteristics to form different genres and gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, the game also offers a wide range of other activities, such as theft, fishing, mining, logging, treasure hunting, roulette wheel gambling, and more.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4122020?t=1762396783","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4122020?t=1762396783","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122020/1b698fdd6881b2baaab61814d1c3a7b4a91d9212/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762396783","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4122020/1b698fdd6881b2baaab61814d1c3a7b4a91d9212/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762396783","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has a high degree of freedom, you can customize the protagonist, and the characters encountered in each game are different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character can be equipped with 6 different weapons, each with unique activ